Notice for the code ported from SciPy's scipy/optimize/_dcsrch.py (the
functions DCSRCH and dcstep of the line search of More and Thuente).

Provenance chain
----------------

1. MINPACK-2 dcsrch.f and dcstep.f (November 1993). The algorithm is that of
   MINPACK-1 (June 1983, More and Thuente).
2. SciPy shipped them as scipy/optimize/minpack2/dcsrch.f and dcstep.f,
   wrapped with f2py.
3. scipy/scipy#19060 (commit 73ce9560ba, 2023-08-24), "port minpack2.dcsrch
   from Fortran to Python", added scipy/optimize/_dcsrch.py and switched the
   line search to it.
4. scipy/scipy#21125 (commit 3073b263fadf1bb97241f4cc29b32c41fa839f90,
   2024-07-06), "remove unused minpack2 fortran code", deleted
   minpack2/dcsrch.f, dcstep.f and minpack2.pyf.
5. SciPy v1.16.3 (b9105ccc2237f57acb1060202cd77f6dd264fb34),
   scipy/optimize/_dcsrch.py: the source of this crate's port.

